/*
  SafetyFeaturesWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0083 · SafetyFeaturesWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SafetyFeaturesWidget` resolves (table "SafetyFeaturesWidget") lives here with
  its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/SafetyFeaturesWidget.tsx) — the shell title, the
  eight ADAS status-cell labels, the Enabled/Disabled values, the compact
  active-feature caption, and the empty message. The remaining keys back the
  native chrome (registry description, the On/Off enum words from
  lib/safetyEnum.ts, freshness chip, refresh/retry/open/empty/error copy, and
  accessibility).
*/

